<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Heritage Montessori · Staff Hub</title>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Cormorant+Garamond:wght@400;600;700&family=Jost:wght@300;400;500;600&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
*, *::before, *::after { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
:root {
  --forest:#2d4a2d; --gold:#b8962e; --cream:#faf7f2; --parchment:#f2ece0;
  --tan:#e8dfc8; --line:#d9cebc; --ink:#1e1e1e; --muted:#6e6456;
  --sage:#5a7a5a; --error:#c0392b; --success:#2d7a4a;
}
body { background:#cfc9bc; font-family:'Jost',sans-serif; min-height:100vh; padding:30px 16px 50px; color:var(--ink); }
.portal { max-width:900px; margin:0 auto; }
.banner { background:var(--forest); color:white; padding:18px 32px; display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:space-between; flex-wrap:wrap; gap:10px; }
.banner h1 { font-family:serif; font-size:20px; font-weight:600; }
.banner p { font-size:10px; letter-spacing:2.5px; text-transform:uppercase; color:rgba(255,255,255,0.55); margin-top:2px; }
.banner-badge { background:var(--gold); color:var(--forest); font-size:9.5px; font-weight:600; letter-spacing:1.5px; text-transform:uppercase; padding:5px 12px; border-radius:2px; }

/* LOGIN */
.login-box { background:var(--cream); padding:52px; box-shadow:0 8px 48px rgba(0,0,0,0.15); text-align:center; }
.login-box h2 { font-family:serif; font-size:24px; color:var(--forest); margin-bottom:8px; }
.login-box p { font-size:12.5px; color:var(--muted); margin-bottom:28px; line-height:1.6; }
.login-row { display:flex; gap:10px; justify-content:center; flex-wrap:wrap; }
.pin-input { border:1.5px solid var(--line); background:var(--parchment); font-family:'Jost',sans-serif; font-size:22px; font-weight:500; letter-spacing:8px; text-align:center; padding:10px 18px; width:170px; outline:none; color:var(--forest); }
.pin-input:focus { border-color:var(--gold); }
.login-error { color:var(--error); font-size:11.5px; margin-top:10px; display:none; }
.pin-hint { font-size:10.5px; color:var(--muted); margin-top:14px; font-style:italic; }

/* BUTTONS */
.btn { padding:11px 26px; font-family:'Jost',sans-serif; font-size:11.5px; font-weight:500; letter-spacing:1.5px; text-transform:uppercase; cursor:pointer; border:none; transition:background 0.2s; border-radius:2px; }
.btn-primary { background:var(--forest); color:white; }
.btn-primary:hover { background:var(--gold); }
.btn-outline { background:transparent; color:var(--muted); border:1.5px solid var(--line); }
.btn-outline:hover { border-color:var(--muted); color:var(--ink); }
.btn-success { background:var(--success); color:white; }
.btn-success:hover { opacity:0.85; }
.btn-danger { background:var(--error); color:white; }
.btn-danger:hover { opacity:0.85; }
.btn-keep { background:#e8f0e8; color:var(--forest); border:1.5px solid #b8d4b8; }
.btn-keep.kept { background:var(--forest); color:white; }
.btn-keep:hover { background:var(--forest); color:white; }
.btn-sm { padding:7px 16px; font-size:10.5px; letter-spacing:1px; }

/* SUMMARY BAR */
.summary-bar { background:var(--cream); padding:18px 32px; box-shadow:0 2px 12px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); border-bottom:2px solid var(--tan); display:flex; gap:0; flex-wrap:wrap; }
.summary-card { flex:1; min-width:100px; padding:8px 20px 8px 0; border-right:1px solid var(--line); margin-right:20px; }
.summary-card:last-child { border-right:none; margin-right:0; }
.summary-num { font-family:serif; font-size:32px; font-weight:700; color:var(--forest); line-height:1; }
.summary-label { font-size:9.5px; font-weight:500; letter-spacing:2px; text-transform:uppercase; color:var(--muted); margin-top:4px; }
.summary-card.new-badge .summary-num { color:var(--gold); }
.summary-card.pending-badge .summary-num { color:#8a6020; }
.summary-card.responded-badge .summary-num { color:var(--success); }

/* NOTIFICATION AREA */
.notif-area { display:none; background:#fffbf0; border-bottom:2px solid var(--gold); padding:14px 32px; }
.notif-area.has-new { display:block; animation:slideDown 0.3s ease; }
@keyframes slideDown { from{opacity:0;transform:translateY(-8px);} to{opacity:1;transform:translateY(0);} }
.notif-title { font-size:10px; font-weight:600; letter-spacing:2px; text-transform:uppercase; color:var(--gold); margin-bottom:10px; display:flex; align-items:center; gap:8px; }
.notif-dot { width:8px; height:8px; background:var(--gold); border-radius:50%; animation:pulse 1.5s infinite; }
@keyframes pulse { 0%,100%{opacity:1;} 50%{opacity:0.3;} }
.notif-list { display:flex; flex-wrap:wrap; gap:8px; }
.notif-chip { background:white; border:1.5px solid var(--gold); padding:6px 14px; font-size:11.5px; color:var(--ink); border-radius:2px; cursor:pointer; display:flex; align-items:center; gap:8px; transition:background 0.15s; }
.notif-chip:hover { background:var(--tan); }
.notif-chip-badge { background:var(--gold); color:var(--forest); font-size:8.5px; font-weight:700; padding:2px 6px; border-radius:10px; }

/* SEARCH */
.search-section { background:var(--cream); padding:18px 32px; box-shadow:0 1px 6px rgba(0,0,0,0.06); border-bottom:1px solid var(--tan); display:flex; gap:12px; align-items:center; flex-wrap:wrap; }
.search-input { flex:1; min-width:200px; border:1.5px solid var(--line); background:var(--parchment); font-family:'Jost',sans-serif; font-size:13px; color:var(--ink); padding:9px 14px; outline:none; }
.search-input:focus { border-color:var(--gold); }
.search-input::placeholder { color:#c0b8ab; }
.filter-btns { display:flex; gap:6px; flex-wrap:wrap; }
.filter-btn { padding:7px 14px; font-family:'Jost',sans-serif; font-size:10.5px; font-weight:500; letter-spacing:1px; text-transform:uppercase; cursor:pointer; border:1.5px solid var(--line); background:transparent; color:var(--muted); border-radius:2px; transition:all 0.15s; display:flex; align-items:center; gap:5px; }
.filter-btn.active { background:var(--forest); border-color:var(--forest); color:white; }
.filter-count { background:rgba(255,255,255,0.3); font-size:9px; padding:1px 5px; border-radius:10px; }
.filter-btn:not(.active) .filter-count { background:var(--line); color:var(--muted); }

/* SUBMISSIONS */
.submissions-area { background:var(--cream); padding:28px 32px; box-shadow:0 8px 48px rgba(0,0,0,0.12); min-height:300px; }
.submissions-title { font-family:serif; font-size:17px; font-weight:600; color:var(--forest); margin-bottom:18px; padding-bottom:10px; border-bottom:1px solid var(--line); display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:space-between; flex-wrap:wrap; gap:8px; }
.sub-count { font-family:'Jost',sans-serif; font-size:11px; font-weight:400; color:var(--muted); }
.empty-state { text-align:center; padding:48px 20px; color:var(--muted); }
.empty-state .ei { font-size:36px; opacity:0.3; margin-bottom:12px; }
.empty-state p { font-size:13px; line-height:1.6; }

/* CARD */
.sub-card { border:1.5px solid var(--line); margin-bottom:14px; overflow:hidden; transition:box-shadow 0.2s; position:relative; }
.sub-card:hover { box-shadow:0 2px 16px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); }
.sub-card.is-new { border-color:var(--gold); }
.sub-card.is-kept { border-color:var(--sage); }
.new-indicator { position:absolute; top:0; left:0; width:4px; height:100%; background:var(--gold); }
.kept-indicator { position:absolute; top:0; left:0; width:4px; height:100%; background:var(--sage); }
.card-header { background:var(--parchment); padding:12px 16px 12px 20px; display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:space-between; flex-wrap:wrap; gap:8px; cursor:pointer; user-select:none; }
.card-header:hover { background:var(--tan); }
.card-name { font-family:serif; font-size:16px; font-weight:600; color:var(--forest); }
.card-meta { font-size:11px; color:var(--muted); margin-top:2px; }
.badges { display:flex; gap:6px; align-items:center; flex-wrap:wrap; }
.badge { font-size:9px; font-weight:600; letter-spacing:1px; text-transform:uppercase; padding:3px 8px; border-radius:2px; }
.b-ptm { background:#e8f0e8; color:var(--forest); }
.b-general { background:#e8edf5; color:#2d4070; }
.b-pending { background:#fdf3e3; color:#8a6020; }
.b-responded { background:#e8f5ec; color:var(--success); }
.b-graded { background:#f0e8f5; color:#6a2d8a; }
.b-new { background:var(--gold); color:white; animation:newPulse 2s ease infinite; }
@keyframes newPulse { 0%,100%{opacity:1;} 50%{opacity:0.7;} }
.b-kept { background:#e8f0e8; color:var(--sage); border:1px solid var(--sage); }
.chevron { font-size:12px; color:var(--muted); transition:transform 0.2s; }
.chevron.open { transform:rotate(180deg); }

/* CARD BODY */
.card-body { display:none; padding:20px 20px 20px 24px; }
.card-body.open { display:block; }
.detail-grid { display:grid; grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr; gap:10px 20px; margin-bottom:16px; background:var(--parchment); padding:14px 16px; border-left:3px solid var(--gold); }
.d-label { font-size:8.5px; font-weight:500; letter-spacing:2px; text-transform:uppercase; color:var(--sage); margin-bottom:3px; }
.d-value { font-size:12.5px; color:var(--ink); line-height:1.5; }
.section-block { margin-bottom:14px; }
.section-block-title { font-size:9px; font-weight:500; letter-spacing:2px; text-transform:uppercase; color:var(--forest); margin-bottom:6px; padding-bottom:4px; border-bottom:1px dashed var(--line); }
.section-block-content { font-size:12.5px; color:var(--ink); line-height:1.65; padding:8px 12px; background:var(--cream); border-left:2px solid var(--line); }
.chip-pills { display:flex; flex-wrap:wrap; gap:5px; }
.chip-pill { background:var(--forest); color:white; font-size:10.5px; padding:3px 10px; border-radius:2px; }

/* CARD ACTIONS */
.card-actions { display:flex; gap:8px; align-items:center; padding:10px 16px 14px 24px; border-top:1px solid var(--tan); background:var(--cream); flex-wrap:wrap; }
.card-action-label { font-size:9.5px; letter-spacing:1.5px; text-transform:uppercase; color:var(--muted); margin-right:4px; }

/* RESPONSE COMPOSER */
.response-composer { margin-top:20px; border-top:1.5px solid var(--line); padding-top:20px; }
.composer-title { font-family:serif; font-size:15px; font-weight:600; color:var(--forest); margin-bottom:14px; display:flex; align-items:center; gap:8px; flex-wrap:wrap; }
.ctag { font-family:'Jost',sans-serif; font-size:9px; font-weight:500; letter-spacing:1.5px; text-transform:uppercase; background:var(--gold); color:var(--forest); padding:2px 8px; border-radius:2px; }
.existing-response { background:var(--parchment); border-left:3px solid var(--success); padding:14px 16px; margin-bottom:14px; font-size:12.5px; color:var(--ink); line-height:1.65; font-style:italic; white-space:pre-wrap; }
.existing-meta { font-size:10px; color:var(--sage); font-style:normal; margin-bottom:8px; font-weight:500; }
.parent-grade-box { background:#f0e8f5; border-left:3px solid #9b59b6; padding:10px 14px; margin-bottom:14px; display:flex; align-items:center; gap:10px; flex-wrap:wrap; }
.pg-label { font-size:11px; font-weight:500; color:#6a2d8a; }
.pg-stars { color:var(--gold); font-size:18px; letter-spacing:2px; }
.pg-desc { font-size:11px; color:var(--muted); font-style:italic; }
.hints-box { background:#f0f5f0; border-left:3px solid var(--sage); padding:10px 14px; margin:10px 0; font-size:11.5px; color:var(--sage); line-height:1.65; }
.hints-box strong { color:var(--forest); }
.response-textarea { width:100%; min-height:130px; border:1.5px solid var(--line); background:var(--parchment); font-family:'Jost',sans-serif; font-size:13px; color:var(--ink); padding:12px 14px; outline:none; resize:vertical; line-height:1.7; }
.response-textarea:focus { border-color:var(--gold); }
.response-textarea::placeholder { color:#c0b8ab; font-size:12px; }
.composer-actions { display:flex; gap:10px; align-items:center; flex-wrap:wrap; margin-top:12px; }
.char-count { font-size:10.5px; color:var(--muted); margin-left:auto; }
.saved-ok { font-size:11px; color:var(--success); font-weight:500; display:none; margin-left:8px; }
.spinner { display:inline-block; width:14px; height:14px; border:2px solid var(--line); border-top-color:var(--forest); border-radius:50%; animation:spin 0.7s linear infinite; vertical-align:middle; margin-right:4px; }
@keyframes spin { to{transform:rotate(360deg);} }

/* NOTIFY PARENT BLOCK */
.notify-parent-block { display:none; margin-top:16px; background:#f0f7f0; border:1.5px solid #b0d4b0; padding:16px 18px; }
.notify-parent-block.show { display:block; animation:fadeIn 0.4s ease; }
@keyframes fadeIn { from{opacity:0;} to{opacity:1;} }
.notify-parent-title { font-size:10px; font-weight:600; letter-spacing:2px; text-transform:uppercase; color:var(--success); margin-bottom:12px; display:flex; align-items:center; gap:8px; }
.notify-parent-title::before { content:'✓'; background:var(--success); color:white; width:18px; height:18px; border-radius:50%; display:inline-flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; font-size:10px; flex-shrink:0; }
.notify-parent-desc { font-size:12px; color:var(--muted); margin-bottom:12px; line-height:1.6; }
.notify-btns { display:flex; gap:10px; flex-wrap:wrap; }
.notify-btn { display:flex; align-items:center; gap:8px; padding:10px 20px; font-family:'Jost',sans-serif; font-size:11.5px; font-weight:500; letter-spacing:1px; text-transform:uppercase; text-decoration:none; border-radius:2px; cursor:pointer; border:none; transition:opacity 0.2s; }
.notify-btn:hover { opacity:0.85; }
.notify-btn-wa { background:#25D366; color:white; }
.notify-btn-copy { background:var(--parchment); color:var(--forest); border:1.5px solid var(--line); }
.notify-no-contact { font-size:11.5px; color:var(--muted); font-style:italic; background:var(--parchment); padding:10px 14px; border-left:3px solid var(--line); }

/* FOOTER */
.panel-footer { background:var(--parchment); display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:space-between; padding:14px 32px; flex-wrap:wrap; gap:8px; }
.panel-footer span { font-size:9.5px; color:rgba(0,0,0,0.35); letter-spacing:1px; text-transform:uppercase; }
.logout-btn { font-size:10.5px; color:var(--muted); cursor:pointer; background:none; border:none; font-family:'Jost',sans-serif; text-decoration:underline; }
.logout-btn:hover { color:var(--error); }

/* TOAST */
.toast { position:fixed; bottom:28px; left:50%; transform:translateX(-50%) translateY(100px); background:var(--forest); color:white; padding:13px 28px; font-size:13px; font-weight:500; border-radius:2px; box-shadow:0 4px 24px rgba(0,0,0,0.25); transition:transform 0.4s ease; z-index:9999; white-space:nowrap; }
.toast.show { transform:translateX(-50%) translateY(0); }

/* LIVE DOT */
.live-dot { display:inline-block; width:8px; height:8px; background:#2ecc71; border-radius:50%; margin-right:6px; animation:pulse 1.5s infinite; }

/* MODAL */
.modal-overlay { display:none; position:fixed; inset:0; background:rgba(0,0,0,0.5); z-index:1000; align-items:center; justify-content:center; }
.modal-overlay.show { display:flex; }
.modal-box { background:var(--cream); padding:36px 40px; max-width:420px; width:90%; box-shadow:0 16px 64px rgba(0,0,0,0.25); }
.modal-box h3 { font-family:serif; font-size:20px; color:var(--forest); margin-bottom:10px; }
.modal-box p { font-size:12.5px; color:var(--muted); line-height:1.65; margin-bottom:24px; }
.modal-btns { display:flex; gap:10px; flex-wrap:wrap; }

/* ACTION MODAL */
.action-modal { display:none; position:fixed; inset:0; background:rgba(0,0,0,0.6); z-index:2000; overflow-y:auto; }
.action-modal.show { display:block; }
.action-modal-inner { background:white; max-width:720px; margin:30px auto; padding:0; box-shadow:0 16px 64px rgba(0,0,0,0.3); }
.action-modal-nav { background:var(--parchment); border-bottom:1px solid var(--line); padding:12px 24px; display:flex; align-items:center; gap:12px; position:sticky; top:0; z-index:10; }
.action-modal-title { font-family:serif; font-size:16px; color:var(--forest); font-weight:600; flex:1; }
.action-modal-body { padding:32px 36px; }
.decision-btns { display:flex; gap:12px; margin:20px 0; flex-wrap:wrap; }
.btn-approve { background:#2d7a4a; color:white; border:none; font-family:'Jost',sans-serif; font-size:11px; font-weight:600; letter-spacing:1px; text-transform:uppercase; padding:10px 22px; cursor:pointer; border-radius:2px; transition:opacity 0.2s; }
.btn-approve:hover { opacity:0.85; }
.btn-reject { background:var(--error); color:white; border:none; font-family:'Jost',sans-serif; font-size:11px; font-weight:600; letter-spacing:1px; text-transform:uppercase; padding:10px 22px; cursor:pointer; border-radius:2px; transition:opacity 0.2s; }
.btn-reject:hover { opacity:0.85; }
.decision-note { width:100%; border:1.5px solid var(--line); background:var(--parchment); font-family:'Jost',sans-serif; font-size:12px; color:var(--ink); padding:10px 12px; resize:vertical; min-height:80px; outline:none; margin-bottom:12px; }
.decision-note:focus { border-color:var(--gold); }
.letter-preview { background:white; border:1px solid var(--line); padding:28px 32px; margin:16px 0; font-size:12px; line-height:2; color:var(--ink); }
.letter-preview h3 { font-family:serif; font-size:18px; color:var(--forest); text-align:center; margin-bottom:4px; }
.letter-preview .letter-sub { text-align:center; font-size:10px; color:var(--muted); margin-bottom:20px; padding-bottom:12px; border-bottom:1px solid var(--line); }

/* ── TABS ── */
.panel-tabs { background:var(--parchment); border-bottom:2px solid var(--line); display:flex; gap:0; }
.panel-tab { padding:13px 26px; font-family:'Jost',sans-serif; font-size:10.5px; font-weight:500; letter-spacing:1.5px; text-transform:uppercase; color:var(--muted); cursor:pointer; border:none; border-bottom:2.5px solid transparent; margin-bottom:-2px; background:none; transition:all 0.2s; display:flex; align-items:center; gap:7px; }
.panel-tab:hover { color:var(--forest); }
.panel-tab.active { color:var(--forest); border-bottom-color:var(--gold); font-weight:600; }

/* ── BANNER BUTTONS ── */
.btn-qr { background:transparent; color:rgba(255,255,255,0.75); border:1.5px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.25); font-family:'Jost',sans-serif; font-size:9.5px; font-weight:600; letter-spacing:1.5px; text-transform:uppercase; padding:5px 12px; border-radius:2px; cursor:pointer; text-decoration:none; display:inline-flex; align-items:center; gap:6px; transition:all 0.2s; }
.btn-qr:hover { background:rgba(255,255,255,0.1); border-color:var(--gold); color:var(--gold); }

/* ── CATEGORY BUTTONS ── */
.records-cat-btn { padding:7px 14px; font-family:'Jost',sans-serif; font-size:10.5px; font-weight:500; letter-spacing:1px; text-transform:uppercase; border:1.5px solid var(--line); background:var(--cream); color:var(--muted); cursor:pointer; border-radius:2px; transition:all 0.2s; display:inline-flex; align-items:center; gap:6px; }
.records-cat-btn:hover { border-color:var(--forest); color:var(--forest); }
.records-cat-btn.active { background:var(--forest); color:white; border-color:var(--forest); }
.records-cat-btn.has-new { border-color:var(--gold); }
.cat-badge { background:var(--line); color:var(--muted); font-size:10px; font-weight:600; padding:1px 7px; border-radius:10px; min-width:20px; text-align:center; }
.records-cat-btn.active .cat-badge { background:rgba(255,255,255,0.25); color:white; }
.records-cat-btn.has-new .cat-badge { background:var(--gold); color:var(--forest); }

/* ── RECORDS TAB ── */
.records-panel { background:var(--cream); padding:28px 32px; min-height:400px; display:none; }
.records-panel.active { display:block; }
.records-filters { display:flex; gap:10px; flex-wrap:wrap; align-items:center; margin-bottom:20px; }
.records-filter-btn { padding:6px 14px; font-family:'Jost',sans-serif; font-size:10px; font-weight:500; letter-spacing:1px; text-transform:uppercase; border:1.5px solid var(--line); background:var(--cream); color:var(--muted); cursor:pointer; border-radius:2px; transition:all 0.2s; }
.records-filter-btn.active { background:var(--forest); color:white; border-color:var(--forest); }
.records-filter-btn:hover { border-color:var(--forest); color:var(--forest); }
.record-card { background:white; border:1.5px solid var(--line); margin-bottom:10px; transition:border-color 0.2s; }
.record-card:hover { border-color:var(--gold); }
.record-header { display:flex; align-items:center; gap:12px; padding:12px 16px; cursor:pointer; flex-wrap:wrap; }
.record-ref { font-family:serif; font-size:15px; font-weight:700; color:var(--forest); min-width:160px; }
.record-name { font-size:13px; font-weight:500; color:var(--ink); flex:1; }
.record-class { font-size:11px; color:var(--muted); background:var(--parchment); padding:2px 8px; border-radius:2px; }
.record-type { font-size:10px; letter-spacing:1px; text-transform:uppercase; color:var(--gold); font-weight:600; }
.record-date { font-size:11px; color:var(--muted); margin-left:auto; white-space:nowrap; }
.status-badge { font-size:9px; font-weight:600; letter-spacing:1.5px; text-transform:uppercase; padding:3px 10px; border-radius:2px; }
.status-pending { background:#fff3e0; color:#e65100; }
.status-processing { background:#e3f2fd; color:#1565c0; }
.status-completed { background:#e8f5ec; color:#2d7a4a; }
.record-body { display:none; padding:14px 16px; border-top:1px solid var(--tan); background:var(--parchment); }
.record-body.open { display:block; }
.record-detail-grid { display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(200px,1fr)); gap:10px; margin-bottom:14px; }
.record-detail { display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:2px; }
.record-detail-label { font-size:8px; letter-spacing:2px; text-transform:uppercase; color:var(--muted); font-weight:600; }
.record-detail-value { font-size:12.5px; color:var(--ink); }
.record-actions { display:flex; gap:8px; flex-wrap:wrap; align-items:center; padding-top:10px; border-top:1px dashed var(--line); }
.btn-status { font-size:9px; font-weight:600; letter-spacing:1px; text-transform:uppercase; padding:5px 12px; border:1.5px solid; cursor:pointer; border-radius:2px; font-family:'Jost',sans-serif; transition:all 0.2s; }
.btn-status-pending { border-color:#e65100; color:#e65100; background:transparent; }
.btn-status-pending:hover { background:#e65100; color:white; }
.btn-status-processing { border-color:#1565c0; color:#1565c0; background:transparent; }
.btn-status-processing:hover { background:#1565c0; color:white; }
.btn-status-completed { border-color:#2d7a4a; color:#2d7a4a; background:transparent; }
.btn-status-completed:hover { background:#2d7a4a; color:white; }
.show-archived-btn { font-size:10px; color:var(--muted); background:none; border:none; cursor:pointer; text-decoration:underline; padding:4px 0; }

/* ── PRINT ── */
.btn-print { background:#f5f5ee; color:var(--muted); border:1.5px solid var(--line); }
.btn-print:hover { background:var(--tan); color:var(--ink); }
.btn-print-all { background:var(--parchment); color:var(--forest); border:1.5px solid var(--gold); }
.btn-print-all:hover { background:var(--gold); color:var(--forest); }
@media print {
  body { background:white !important; padding:0 !important; }
  .portal { max-width:100% !important; }

  /* Hide all UI */
  .banner, .login-box, .summary-bar, .notif-area, .search-section,
  .card-actions, .response-composer, .panel-footer,
  .toast, .notify-parent-block, .hints-box, .chevron, .panel-tabs,
  .action-modal-nav, .records-filters, .submissions-title,
  #tabFeedback, #tabRecords { display:none !important; }

  /* Show Documents tab */
  #tabDocuments { display:block !important; }

  /* Hide all doc sections except the active one */
  .doc-form-section { display:none !important; box-shadow:none !important; border:none !important; }
  .doc-form-section.active { display:block !important; }
  .doc-docs-list { display:none !important; }
  .doc-nav, .doc-back-btn, .doc-print-btn { display:none !important; }
  .doc-form-body { padding:0 !important; display:block !important; }


  /* When action modal is open - show only its content */
  .action-modal { display:block !important; position:static !important; background:white !important; overflow:visible !important; }
  .action-modal-inner { box-shadow:none !important; max-width:100% !important; margin:0 !important; }
  .action-modal-nav { display:none !important; }
  #actionModalBody { display:block !important; padding:0 !important; }
  #actionModalBody > div:first-child { display:none !important; }
  #actionModalBody > div:last-child { display:none !important; }
  .letter-preview { border:none !important; padding:0 !important; }
  #admissionPrintBody { border:none !important; padding:0 !important; }

  /* Submission cards print */
  .submissions-area { box-shadow:none !important; padding:0 !important; background:white !important; }
  .submissions-title { display:none !important; }
  .sub-card { border:1px solid #ccc !important; margin-bottom:24px !important; page-break-inside:avoid; box-shadow:none !important; }
  .sub-card.print-hide { display:none !important; }
  .card-body { display:block !important; padding:14px !important; }
  .card-header { background:#f2ece0 !important; }

  /* Checkboxes show correctly */
  input[type=checkbox] { -webkit-print-color-adjust:exact !important; print-color-adjust:exact !important; }

  @page { size:A4; margin:15mm; }
}
.print-header { display:none; text-align:center; margin-bottom:24px; padding-bottom:14px; border-bottom:2px solid #2d4a2d; }
.print-header h2 { font-family:serif; font-size:20px; color:#2d4a2d; font-weight:600; }
.print-header p { font-size:10px; color:#6e6456; margin-top:5px; letter-spacing:1.5px; text-transform:uppercase; }

/* ── DOCUMENTS TAB ── */
.docs-panel { background:var(--cream); padding:28px 32px; min-height:400px; display:none; }
.docs-panel.active { display:block; }
.docs-grid { display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(240px,1fr)); gap:14px; margin-top:20px; }
.doc-card { background:var(--cream); border:1.5px solid var(--line); padding:20px; cursor:pointer; transition:all 0.2s; position:relative; }
.doc-card::before { content:''; position:absolute; top:0; left:0; right:0; height:3px; background:var(--gold); opacity:0; transition:opacity 0.2s; }
.doc-card:hover { border-color:var(--gold); box-shadow:0 4px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); }
.doc-card:hover::before { opacity:1; }
.doc-icon { font-size:26px; margin-bottom:10px; }
.doc-title { font-family:serif; font-size:16px; font-weight:600; color:var(--forest); margin-bottom:4px; }
.doc-desc { font-size:11px; color:var(--muted); line-height:1.6; margin-bottom:14px; }
.doc-open-btn { display:inline-flex; align-items:center; gap:6px; background:var(--forest); color:white; font-family:'Jost',sans-serif; font-size:10px; font-weight:500; letter-spacing:1.5px; text-transform:uppercase; padding:8px 16px; border:none; cursor:pointer; border-radius:2px; transition:background 0.2s; }
.doc-open-btn:hover { background:var(--gold); color:var(--forest); }

/* ── DOCUMENT FORM VIEW ── */
.doc-form-section { display:none; background:white; }
.doc-form-section.active { display:block; }
.doc-nav { background:var(--parchment); border-bottom:1px solid var(--line); padding:12px 28px; display:flex; align-items:center; gap:14px; flex-wrap:wrap; }
.doc-back-btn { background:none; border:1.5px solid var(--line); color:var(--muted); font-family:'Jost',sans-serif; font-size:10px; font-weight:500; letter-spacing:1px; text-transform:uppercase; padding:6px 14px; cursor:pointer; border-radius:2px; display:flex; align-items:center; gap:6px; }
.doc-back-btn:hover { border-color:var(--forest); color:var(--forest); }
.doc-print-btn { background:var(--forest); color:white; border:none; font-family:'Jost',sans-serif; font-size:10px; font-weight:600; letter-spacing:1.5px; text-transform:uppercase; padding:8px 20px; cursor:pointer; border-radius:2px; display:flex; align-items:center; gap:7px; transition:background 0.2s; }
.doc-print-btn:hover { background:var(--gold); color:var(--forest); }
.doc-form-body { max-width:720px; margin:0 auto; padding:36px 40px; }
.doc-form-header { text-align:center; border-bottom:2px solid var(--forest); padding-bottom:18px; margin-bottom:28px; }
.doc-form-header h2 { font-family:serif; font-size:20px; font-weight:700; color:var(--forest); }
.doc-form-header p { font-size:10.5px; color:var(--muted); margin-top:3px; }
.doc-form-header .doc-ref { font-size:11px; color:var(--muted); margin-top:10px; display:flex; justify-content:space-between; flex-wrap:wrap; gap:8px; }
.field-row { display:grid; grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr; gap:16px; margin-bottom:14px; }
.field-row.full { grid-template-columns:1fr; }
.field-group { display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:4px; }
.field-label { font-size:9px; font-weight:600; letter-spacing:2px; text-transform:uppercase; color:var(--sage); }
.field-input { border:none; border-bottom:1.5px solid var(--line); background:transparent; font-family:'Jost',sans-serif; font-size:13px; color:var(--ink); padding:6px 0; outline:none; width:100%; }
.field-input:focus { border-bottom-color:var(--gold); }
.field-select { border:none; border-bottom:1.5px solid var(--line); background:transparent; font-family:'Jost',sans-serif; font-size:13px; color:var(--ink); padding:6px 0; outline:none; width:100%; cursor:pointer; }
.field-select:focus { border-bottom-color:var(--gold); }
.doc-body-text { font-size:13px; color:var(--ink); line-height:2; margin:20px 0; }
.doc-body-text .blank { display:inline-block; min-width:160px; border-bottom:1.5px solid var(--ink); text-align:center; font-style:italic; color:var(--muted); }
.doc-section-title { font-size:9px; font-weight:600; letter-spacing:2.5px; text-transform:uppercase; color:var(--forest); margin:22px 0 12px; padding-bottom:5px; border-bottom:1px dashed var(--line); }
.doc-clause { font-size:12px; color:var(--ink); line-height:1.8; margin-bottom:10px; padding-left:16px; }
.doc-clause strong { color:var(--forest); }
.doc-sign-row { display:grid; grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr; gap:40px; margin-top:40px; }
.doc-sign-box { border-top:1px solid var(--ink); padding-top:8px; font-size:11px; color:var(--muted); text-align:center; }
.form-actions { display:flex; gap:10px; margin-top:24px; padding-top:16px; border-top:1px solid var(--line); }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="portal">
  <div class="banner">
    <div>
      <h1>Heritage Montessori &amp; School</h1>
      <p>Nurturing Young Minds · Est. 2007</p>
    </div>
    <div style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;flex-wrap:wrap;">
      <a href="/heritage-qr-poster" target="_blank" class="btn-qr">🖨 Print QR Poster</a>
      <div class="banner-badge">Staff Hub</div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- LOGIN -->
  <div class="login-box" id="loginBox">
    <div style="font-size:40px;margin-bottom:14px;opacity:0.35;">🔐</div>
    <h2>Staff Access Only</h2>
    <p>This panel is for Heritage Montessori staff to review parent feedback<br>and post official school responses. Enter your staff PIN to continue.</p>
    <div class="login-row">
      <input class="pin-input" type="password" id="pinInput" maxlength="6" placeholder="· · · · · ·" onkeydown="if(event.key==='Enter')checkPin()">
      <button class="btn btn-primary" onclick="checkPin()">Enter →</button>
    </div>
    <div class="login-error" id="loginError">⚠ Incorrect PIN. Please try again.</div>
    <div class="pin-hint">Contact the school administrator if you have forgotten your PIN.</div>
  </div>

  <!-- MAIN PANEL -->
  <div id="mainPanel" style="display:none;">

    <!-- SUMMARY BAR -->
    <div class="summary-bar">
      <div class="summary-card">
        <div class="summary-num" id="statTotal">—</div>
        <div class="summary-label">Total Received</div>
      </div>
      <div class="summary-card new-badge">
        <div class="summary-num" id="statNew">—</div>
        <div class="summary-label">📦 New / Unread</div>
      </div>
      <div class="summary-card pending-badge">
        <div class="summary-num" id="statPending">—</div>
        <div class="summary-label">⏳ Pending Reply</div>
      </div>
      <div class="summary-card responded-badge">
        <div class="summary-num" id="statResponded">—</div>
        <div class="summary-label">✓ Responded</div>
      </div>
      <div class="summary-card">
        <div class="summary-num" id="statKept">—</div>
        <div class="summary-label">📌 Kept</div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- NOTIFICATION AREA -->
    <div class="notif-area" id="notifArea">
      <div class="notif-title">
        <span class="notif-dot"></span>
        New Messages — tap to jump
      </div>
      <div class="notif-list" id="notifList"></div>
    </div>

    <!-- TAB BAR -->
    <div class="panel-tabs">
      <button class="panel-tab active" id="tabFeedbackBtn" onclick="switchTab('feedback',this)">📋 Parent Feedback</button>
      <button class="panel-tab" id="tabDocsBtn" onclick="switchTab('documents',this)">📄 Staff Documents</button>
      <button class="panel-tab" id="tabRecordsBtn" onclick="switchTab('records',this)">📁 Form Records</button>
    </div>

    <!-- ═══════════════ FEEDBACK TAB ═══════════════ -->
    <div id="tabFeedback">

    <!-- SEARCH & FILTER -->
    <div class="search-section">
      <input class="search-input" type="text" id="searchInput" placeholder="Search by child's name, class, or parent…" oninput="filterCards()">
      <select class="search-input" id="classFilter" onchange="filterCards()" style="max-width:140px;cursor:pointer;">
        <option value="">All Classes</option>
        <option>Mont 1</option><option>Mont 2</option><option>Mont 3</option>
        <option>Class 1</option><option>Class 2</option><option>Class 3</option><option>Class 4</option><option>Class 5</option>
      </select>
      <select class="search-input" id="monthFilter" onchange="filterCards()" style="max-width:150px;cursor:pointer;">
        <option value="">All Months</option>
      </select>
      <button class="btn btn-outline btn-sm" onclick="resetFilters()" style="white-space:nowrap;">✕ Reset</button>
      <!-- FEEDBACK CATEGORY BUTTONS -->
      <div style="display:flex;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-bottom:10px;">
        <button class="records-cat-btn active" id="fcat-all" onclick="setFeedbackCat('all',this)">
          All <span class="cat-badge" id="fcatbadge-all">0</span>
        </button>
        <button class="records-cat-btn" id="fcat-new" onclick="setFeedbackCat('new',this)" style="border-color:var(--gold);">
          📦 New <span class="cat-badge" id="fcatbadge-new" style="background:var(--gold);color:var(--forest);">0</span>
        </button>
        <button class="records-cat-btn" id="fcat-pending" onclick="setFeedbackCat('pending',this)">
          ⏳ Pending <span class="cat-badge" id="fcatbadge-pending">0</span>
        </button>
        <button class="records-cat-btn" id="fcat-responded" onclick="setFeedbackCat('responded',this)">
          ✓ Responded <span class="cat-badge" id="fcatbadge-responded">0</span>
        </button>
        <button class="records-cat-btn" id="fcat-kept" onclick="setFeedbackCat('kept',this)">
          📌 Kept <span class="cat-badge" id="fcatbadge-kept">0</span>
        </button>
      </div>

      <div class="filter-btns">
        <button class="filter-btn active" onclick="setFilter('all',this)">All <span class="filter-count" id="fc-all">0</span></button>
        <button class="filter-btn" onclick="setFilter('new',this)">New <span class="filter-count" id="fc-new">0</span></button>
        <button class="filter-btn" onclick="setFilter('pending',this)">Pending <span class="filter-count" id="fc-pending">0</span></button>
        <button class="filter-btn" onclick="setFilter('responded',this)">Responded <span class="filter-count" id="fc-responded">0</span></button>
        <button class="filter-btn" onclick="setFilter('kept',this)">📌 Kept <span class="filter-count" id="fc-kept">0</span></button>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- SUBMISSIONS LIST -->
    <div class="submissions-area">
      <div class="submissions-title">
        <span><span class="live-dot"></span>Live Submissions</span>
        <span style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap;">
          <span class="sub-count" id="subCountLabel">Loading…</span>
          <button class="btn btn-print-all btn-sm" onclick="printAll()" title="Print all visible submissions">🖨 Print All</button>
        </span>
      </div>
      <div class="print-header" id="printHeader">
        <h2>Heritage Montessori &amp; School — Parent Feedback</h2>
        <p id="printMeta">Staff Panel Report</p>
      </div>
      <div id="submissionsList">
        <div class="empty-state"><div class="ei">⏳</div><p>Loading submissions…</p></div>
      </div>
    </div>

    </div><!-- /tabFeedback -->

    <!-- ═══════════════ DOCUMENTS TAB ═══════════════ -->
    <div id="tabDocuments" class="docs-panel">

      <!-- DOCUMENT LIST VIEW -->
      <div id="docListView">
        <div class="submissions-title">
          <span>📄 Staff Document Templates</span>
          <span class="sub-count">Fill in and print directly in browser</span>
        <div class="docs-grid">

          <div class="doc-card">
            <div class="doc-icon">📝</div>
            <div class="doc-title">Appointment Letter</div>
            <div class="doc-desc">For newly appointed teachers. Includes designation, salary, probation period and terms.</div>
            <button class="doc-open-btn" onclick="openDoc('appointment')">📝 Fill &amp; Print</button>
          </div>

          <div class="doc-card">
            <div class="doc-icon">🎓</div>
            <div class="doc-title">Bonafide Certificate</div>
            <div class="doc-desc">Confirms a student is currently enrolled at Heritage Montessori.</div>
            <button class="doc-open-btn" onclick="openDoc('bonafide')">📝 Fill &amp; Print</button>
          </div>

          <div class="doc-card">
            <div class="doc-icon">🏫</div>
            <div class="doc-title">School Leaving Certificate</div>
            <div class="doc-desc">Issued when a student leaves the school. Includes character and clearance.</div>
            <button class="doc-open-btn" onclick="openDoc('leaving')">📝 Fill &amp; Print</button>
          </div>

          <div class="doc-card">
            <div class="doc-icon">👩‍🏫</div>
            <div class="doc-title">Experience Letter</div>
            <div class="doc-desc">For teachers and staff leaving the school. Confirms designation, tenure and performance.</div>
            <button class="doc-open-btn" onclick="openDoc('experience')">📝 Fill &amp; Print</button>
          </div>

        </div>
        <div style="margin-top:20px;background:var(--parchment);border:1px solid var(--line);border-left:3px solid var(--gold);padding:12px 16px;font-size:11.5px;color:var(--muted);line-height:1.7;">
          <strong style="color:var(--forest);">How to use:</strong> Click Fill &amp; Print on any template. Fill in the fields, then click the Print button — the form prints cleanly without any panel elements. Each form is freshly filled every time.
        </div>

        <!-- PIN GENERATOR -->
        <div style="margin-top:20px;background:var(--cream);border:1.5px solid var(--line);padding:20px;">
          <div style="font-size:9px;letter-spacing:2.5px;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--forest);font-weight:600;margin-bottom:4px;">🔑 Parent Portal PIN Generator</div>
          <div style="font-size:11.5px;color:var(--muted);margin-bottom:14px;line-height:1.6;">Generate a one-time PIN to share with a new parent. Each PIN can only be used once to access the Parent Admission Portal.</div>
          <div style="display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:center;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-bottom:12px;">
            <div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:4px;">
              <div style="font-size:9px;letter-spacing:2px;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--sage);font-weight:600;">PIN Valid For</div>
              <select id="pinExpiry" class="search-input" style="max-width:140px;cursor:pointer;padding:7px 10px;">
                <option value="4">4 Hours</option>
                <option value="8" selected>8 Hours</option>
                <option value="24">24 Hours</option>
                <option value="48">48 Hours</option>
              </select>
            </div>
            <div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:4px;">
              <div style="font-size:9px;letter-spacing:2px;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--sage);font-weight:600;">Parent Name</div>
              <input type="text" id="pinParentName" class="search-input" style="max-width:180px;" placeholder="Parent name (optional)">
            </div>
            <button class="btn btn-primary btn-sm" onclick="generateParentPin()" id="genPinBtn" style="margin-top:18px;">Generate PIN</button>
          </div>
          <div style="display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:center;flex-wrap:wrap;">
            <div id="generatedPin" style="display:none;background:var(--forest);color:var(--gold);font-family:serif;font-size:28px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:8px;padding:8px 20px;"></div>
            <button id="copyPinBtn" class="btn btn-outline btn-sm" style="display:none;" onclick="copyPin()">📋 Copy PIN</button>
            <a id="waPinBtn" href="#" target="_blank" class="btn btn-sm" style="display:none;background:#25D366;color:white;text-decoration:none;">💬 Share on WhatsApp</a>
          </div>
          <div id="pinGenNote" style="display:none;font-size:10.5px;color:var(--success);margin-top:10px;font-weight:500;line-height:1.6;"></div>
        </div>
      </div>
      

      <!-- APPOINTMENT LETTER FORM -->
      <div id="docAppointment" class="doc-form-section">
        <div class="doc-nav">
          <button class="doc-back-btn" onclick="closeDoc()">← Back to Documents</button>
          <span style="font-family:serif;font-size:16px;color:var(--forest);font-weight:600;">Appointment Letter</span>
          <button class="doc-print-btn" onclick="printDoc()">🖨 Print</button>
        </div>
        <div class="doc-form-body" id="printAppointment">

          <div class="doc-form-header">
            <h2>Heritage Montessori and School</h2>
            <p>11-D Garden Town, Multan &nbsp;·&nbsp; Tel: 061-6515260 / 0336-1515260 &nbsp;·&nbsp; info@heritagemux.com</p>
            <div class="doc-ref">
              <span>Date: <input class="field-input" style="width:140px;" placeholder="dd/mm/yyyy"></span>
              <span>Ref No: <input class="field-input" style="width:120px;" placeholder="HMS/APT/__/26"></span>
            </div>
          </div></div>

          <div class="doc-section-title">Addressee</div>
          <div class="field-row">
            <div class="field-group"><div class="field-label">Full Name</div><input class="field-input" placeholder="Ms. / Mr."></div>
            <div class="field-group"><div class="field-label">S/o · D/o · W/o</div><input class="field-input" placeholder="Father / Husband name"></div>
          </div>
          <div class="field-row full">
            <div class="field-group"><div class="field-label">Residential Address</div><input class="field-input" placeholder="Full residential address"></div>
          </div>

          <div class="doc-section-title">Appointment Details</div>
          <div class="field-row">
            <div class="field-group"><div class="field-label">Designation</div><input class="field-input" placeholder="e.g. Class Teacher — Mont 1"></div>
            <div class="field-group"><div class="field-label">Section</div><select class="field-select"><option>Montessori</option><option>Junior</option><option>Both Sections</option><option>Administration</option></select></div>
          </div>
          <div class="field-row">
            <div class="field-group"><div class="field-label">Date of Joining</div><input class="field-input" placeholder="dd/mm/yyyy"></div>
            <div class="field-group"><div class="field-label">Monthly Salary (Rs.)</div><input class="field-input" placeholder="e.g. 25,000"></div>
          </div>
          <div class="field-row">
            <div class="field-group"><div class="field-label">Probation Period</div><select class="field-select"><option>Three (3) months</option><option>Six (6) months</option><option>One (1) month</option></select></div>
            <div class="field-group"><div class="field-label">Academic Year</div><input class="field-input" placeholder="e.g. 2026–27"></div>
          </div>

          <div class="doc-body-text" style="margin-top:24px;line-height:2.2;">
            Dear <input class="field-input" style="width:200px;" placeholder="Ms./Mr. Name">,<br><br>

            It is our pleasure to formally welcome you to Heritage Montessori and School as part of the faculty. With reference to your application and subsequent interview, we are pleased to appoint you as <strong><input class="field-input" style="width:200px;" placeholder="Designation"></strong>, with effect from <strong><input class="field-input" style="width:140px;" placeholder="Date of Joining"></strong>. Your monthly salary shall be <strong>Rs. <input class="field-input" style="width:90px;" placeholder="Amount"></strong>.<br><br>

            The following terms, conditions, and institutional guidelines govern your employment at Heritage Montessori and School. These have been formulated to help you settle into a comfortable and productive association with the institution. These terms in no way undermine your rights as an employee; however, please keep in mind that duties take precedence in bringing quality to any workplace — and we expect to witness our students shine in the best possible way.
          </div>

          <div style="border:1px solid var(--line);padding:18px 22px;margin:16px 0;background:var(--parchment);">
            <div style="font-size:10px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:2px;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--forest);margin-bottom:14px;border-bottom:1.5px solid var(--gold);padding-bottom:6px;">Terms and Conditions of Employment</div>
            <div style="font-size:12px;line-height:2.2;color:var(--ink);">

              <strong>1. Documentation Required on Joining</strong><br>
              Upon confirmation as a permanent or probationary teacher, you are required to submit the following to the school office:<br>
              (a) &nbsp; 2 × photocopies of your National Identity Card (NIC) and 2 × passport-size photographs.<br>
              (b) &nbsp; Complete, correct and up-to-date personal information including working cell phone numbers on which you can be contacted at all times.<br>
              (c) &nbsp; Bank account details for salary disbursement. Providing bank account details is mandatory. In the event a teacher wishes salary to be credited to an account operated by another person, a specific written request must be submitted to the school office stating the account details and the reason, and this must be approved by the management before disbursement.<br><br>

              <strong>2. Academic Year</strong><br>
              The academic year runs from August/September to May/June.<br><br>

              <strong>3. Security Deposit</strong><br>
              By signing this letter, you give your written consent for your first month's salary to be retained by the school as a refundable security deposit. This will be refunded upon your departure subject to the following conditions:<br>
              (a) &nbsp; You have successfully completed your probation period.<br>
              (b) &nbsp; You have submitted your written resignation in person to the school office with the required one (1) month's notice.<br>
              (c) &nbsp; The school reserves the right to forfeit the security deposit if you resign or discontinue without giving the required one month's prior notice, or if your services are terminated on grounds of misconduct.<br><br>

              <strong>4. Probation Period</strong><br>
              From the date of joining you will be placed on a probation period for the defined period stated in this letter. The following conditions apply:<br>
              (a) &nbsp; No planned leave, other than genuine emergencies, is admissible during the probation period.<br>
              (b) &nbsp; Any increment or raise upon completion of probation will be dependent on performance as assessed by the school heads.<br>
              (c) &nbsp; Keeping in view the aptitude and ability of the individual, teachers may be assigned a different class or subject other than the one initially appointed for.<br>
              (d) &nbsp; Should a teacher wish to discontinue during the probation period, she/he is required to inform the school in writing. Discontinuation during probation will result in forfeiture of the security deposit and no experience certificate will be issued.<br>
              (e) &nbsp; No experience certificate will be issued if a teacher fails to complete the probation period satisfactorily.<br>
              (f) &nbsp; All rules applicable to a confirmed employee are equally applicable to a probationary teacher.<br>
              (g) &nbsp; Upon successful completion of the probation period, you will be considered a confirmed staff member of Heritage Montessori and School.<br>
              (h) &nbsp; You are required to follow all prescribed school timings from the first day of joining.<br><br>

              <strong>5. Attendance, Timings and Leave</strong><br>
              (a) &nbsp; Adherence to prescribed school timings is mandatory for all staff. No excuse, other than a genuine emergency, is acceptable.<br>
              (b) &nbsp; Three (3) late arrivals in one calendar month will result in a deduction of one (1) day's salary for that month. By signing this letter you give your consent to this deduction as a contractual term.<br>
              (c) &nbsp; Leave must be planned well in advance. A leave application must be submitted at least three (3) weeks before the intended leave date through the <strong>HMS-Attendance App</strong>. Following the app submission, the administration must also be informed in person. Emergency leave must be reported immediately and followed up with a written explanation.<br>
              (d) &nbsp; Any leave immediately preceding or following a weekend or public holiday will be counted as a continuous block of absence inclusive of that weekend or holiday.<br>
              (e) &nbsp; No salary review or increment will be considered if the teacher has been absent or on leave during the last three months, other than for approved emergency reasons.<br><br>

              <strong>6. Annual Increment</strong><br>
              (a) &nbsp; Teachers are entitled to an annual increment of 5% to 10%, subject to performance as assessed by the school heads as per the assessment pattern designed in the <strong>HMS-SPA (Staff Performance Assessment)</strong>. The exact percentage will be communicated in writing at the time the increment is awarded. This has no effect on the summer vacation salary.<br>
              (b) &nbsp; Annual increment is admissible from the date of successful completion of the probation period.<br>
              (c) &nbsp; The increment will be calculated on the basic salary at the time of completion of the probation period.<br>
              (d) &nbsp; No salary review will be considered unless the following conditions are met:<br>
              &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;(i) &nbsp; Minimum five (5) consecutive months of service at the institution.<br>
              &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;(ii) &nbsp; No unapproved absence during the last three months.<br>
              &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;(iii) &nbsp; Not more than three late arrivals in the last three months.<br>
              &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;(iv) &nbsp; Satisfactory performance as per the job requirements of the institution.<br><br>

              <strong>7. Summer Vacation Salary</strong><br>
              (a) &nbsp; Summer vacation salary is admissible to teachers who have completed their probation period and have worked for at least one (1) full academic year at Heritage Montessori and School, excluding summer vacations.<br>
              (b) &nbsp; Summer vacation salary for June will be paid with the September salary, and for July will be paid with the January salary.<br>
              (c) &nbsp; Summer vacation salary will be paid at the rate of the basic salary at the time of completion of the probation period.<br>
              (d) &nbsp; A teacher who resigns or whose services are terminated before the start of the new academic session, and who was otherwise entitled to summer vacation salary, will forfeit the right to that earned summer vacation salary.<br><br>

              <strong>8. Notice Period and Resignation</strong><br>
              (a) &nbsp; Either party may terminate this appointment by giving one (1) month's written notice. If you resign without serving the required notice period, the school reserves the right to withhold the equivalent amount from your final dues or security deposit.<br>
              (b) &nbsp; Resignation must be submitted in writing, in person, to the school office. The school will process the resignation and release dues upon completion of the notice period and satisfactory handover.<br>
              (c) &nbsp; The school may waive the notice period at its sole discretion in special circumstances.<br><br>

              <strong>9. Termination</strong><br>
              The school reserves the right to terminate this appointment immediately and without notice in cases of gross misconduct, dishonesty, insubordination, repeated absence, or any act that brings disrepute to the institution. In such cases the security deposit shall be forfeited and no experience certificate or summer vacation salary shall be payable.<br><br>

              <strong>10. Experience Certificate</strong><br>
              A teacher is eligible to receive an experience certificate only upon completing a minimum of eight (8) consecutive months after the probation period and having fulfilled all conditions of service satisfactorily.<br><br>

              <strong>11. Mobile Phone Policy</strong><br>
              Personal mobile phones must be switched off or on silent during class hours. Use of mobile phones in the classroom or in the presence of students is strictly prohibited and may result in disciplinary action.<br><br>

              <strong>12. Dress Code and Professional Conduct</strong><br>
              You are required to dress formally and appropriately on all working days. Behaviour unbecoming of a teacher — inside or outside school premises — may result in disciplinary action. All interactions with students, parents and colleagues must remain respectful and professional at all times.<br><br>

              <strong>13. Duties and Responsibilities</strong><br>
              In addition to classroom teaching, you may be assigned duties including lesson planning, student assessments, parent-teacher meetings, school events, co-curricular activities, supervision, and any other task assigned by the management. You are required to maintain lesson plans, student records, and assessment registers as directed.<br><br>

              <strong>14. Parent Communication</strong><br>
              All communication with parents must take place through official school channels. Teachers must not share personal contact numbers with parents or engage in unofficial communication with parents outside the school's approved channels without prior approval from the management.<br><br>

              <strong>15. Confidentiality</strong><br>
              All student records, parent information, academic data, salary details, and institutional matters are strictly confidential. You must not share, disclose, or discuss any such information outside the school during or after your employment. This obligation continues after the termination of employment.<br><br>

              <strong>16. Care of School Property</strong><br>
              All school property, teaching materials, books, stationery and equipment issued to you must be maintained with care and returned in good condition upon departure. Any damage or loss due to negligence may be recovered from your salary or final dues, as agreed by signing this letter.<br><br>

              <strong>17. Social Media</strong><br>
              You must not post, share or publish any content related to the school, its students, staff or management on any social media platform without prior written approval from the management. Any violation of this clause may result in immediate disciplinary action.<br><br>

              <strong>18. Compliance with School Policies</strong><br>
              You are required to comply with all policies, procedures, and directives issued by the management from time to time including the staff handbook, academic guidelines, examination policies and any circular issued during the course of employment.<br><br>

              <strong>19. Legal Proceedings</strong><br>
              Heritage Montessori and School reserves the right to take necessary legal action against any violation of the terms mentioned in this document. In the event of any legal proceedings, the teacher shall bear all expenses incurred, irrespective of the outcome of the case. Any disputes shall be subject to the jurisdiction of courts in Multan.

            </div>
